{"title":"[精彩瞬间]周舜英总经理的主题演讲","date":"2017-06-08","content":"<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:28.0pt;\r\nmso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:21.0pt;font-family:宋体\">[</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:21.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体\">精彩瞬间<span lang=\"EN-US\">]</span>周舜英总经理的主题演讲<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:30.1pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:宋体\">&nbsp;</span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:宋体\">在这次研讨会上，四位企业负责人从不同的专业理念上，介绍其不同的研究、做法和经验，探索不同专业的项目管理发展之路，为项目管理的发展提供方向和指引。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:宋体\">下面，让我们一起回顾广东永道工程咨询有限公司周舜英总经理的精彩演讲。</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:宋体\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201706/IMG_5699.JPG\" style=\"float: left;\" /></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:宋体\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-align: center;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:center;text-indent:32.15pt;\r\nmso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nfont-family:宋体\">BIM</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:宋体\">技术在项目投资管理方面的应用探讨</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:宋体\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:宋体\">探讨了<span lang=\"EN-US\">BIM</span>技术如何协同管理平台来提高项目投资管理水平；传统投资管理方式的局限性分析；<span lang=\"EN-US\">BIM</span>技术的实际应用方面；<span lang=\"EN-US\">BIM</span>技术应用时间不长，应用当中存在哪些障碍，我们又如何思考与处理。</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:宋体\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:宋体\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201706/IMG_5700.JPG\" style=\"float: left;\" /></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-align: center;\">\r\n\t<strong style=\"font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif; text-align: center; white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(78, 56, 56); line-height: 42px; box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"